.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-service-renew - Renew service (path: {id})


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro service renew  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Renew service (path: {id})

.PP
Renew service (path: {id}). Service of the calling account (any product line). \fBSpends money / creates an invoice.\fP Money rules apply (AK-40): \fB"confirm": true\fR in the body, an \fBIdempotency-Key\fR header, account balance only (no stored card), daily limit of paid API operations per account (default 50, operator can override per account/reseller, resets 00:00 Europe/Istanbul); violations answer 422 with \fB[confirm_required]\fR, \fB[idempotency_key_required]\fR, \fB[balance_only]\fR or \fB[daily_limit]\fR in the message. Core WISECP client endpoint (Turkish reference: https://dev.wisecp.com/tr/sahip-olunan-hizmetler).

.PP
API: POST /services/{id}/renew (operationId coreRenewService, scope Services/RenewService)


